  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at the office, Kawada opens his heart and begs Muranishi to film an unforgettable work with Kuroki again—yet Muranishi sets up a prize tip line and announces four more celebrity gossip videos from a balcony above protesting fans.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、局にケンカ売ってどうするんですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "我々は世間に認められてるんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あんなのただのゴシップ作品でしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "僕ね、黒木君のビデオがもう大好きなんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "また見たことない作品撮ってくださいよ。お願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かりました。撮りますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "芸能人とのエピソードを教えてくれた君に賞金をお贈りします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "新しい情報来たよ！これもいいっすよ、若手俳優！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本日は私どものためにお集まりいただき誠にありがとうございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今回は四本同時発売です！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "幻想を追いかけても意味がない！真実にたどり着くのです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ぜひご覧ください！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、局にケンカ売ってどうするんですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, what good does picking a fight with the TV network do!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "我々は世間に認められてるんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The public out there is embracing what we make.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あんなのただのゴシップ作品でしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those tapes are nothing more than cheap gossip videos.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "僕ね、黒木君のビデオがもう大好きなんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen, Mr. Muranishi—I truly love the film you made with Kuroki.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "また見たことない作品撮ってくださいよ。お願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please shoot another groundbreaking film like we've never seen before. Please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かりました。撮りますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right. I will shoot one.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "芸能人とのエピソードを教えてくれた君に賞金をお贈りします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are offering prize money to callers who share celebrity stories.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "新しい情報来たよ！これもいいっすよ、若手俳優！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A new tip just came in! This one on a young actor is great too!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本日は私どものためにお集まりいただき誠にありがとうございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all so much for gathering out here for us today!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今回は四本同時発売です！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This time, we are releasing four new titles simultaneously!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "幻想を追いかけても意味がない！真実にたどり着くのです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chasing illusions is pointless! Watch these and reach the truth!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ぜひご覧ください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please be sure to watch them!'",
